---
description: Require risk-proportionate automated tests and truthful quality reporting.
globs: "{src/**/*.ts,tests/**/*.ts,specs/**/*.md}"
alwaysApply: false
---

- Trace tests to active acceptance criteria and business invariants.
- Add unit tests for domain behavior and integration tests for database/API boundaries.
- Test authorization failures, validation failures, ownership, and invalid state transitions.
- Test idempotency and concurrency for payments, queues, transitions, assignments, and winner selection when applicable.
- Use deterministic fixtures and isolate external adapters.
- Add regression coverage for every accepted defect or review finding.
- Never claim a check passed without running it and reporting the actual command/result.
